 101:Core/Src/main.c **** /* LPUART1 receive path: DMA writes here continuously, the main loop follows it.
 102:Core/Src/main.c ****  * hdma_lpuart1_rx itself is CubeMX-generated (LPUART1 -> DMA Settings in the
 103:Core/Src/main.c ****  * .ioc: DMA1 Channel2, circular, byte-wide). */
